  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Response to Venezuelan Migrants and Refugees in Colombia, Ecuador, Peru and Venezuela &#x2013; Phase IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to continue improving access to protection and health services (including mental health and psychosocial support), as well as strengthening humanitarian assistance (shelter, water and sanitation), child protection, prevention and mitigation of gender-based violence and the integration of the migrant and refugee population from Venezuela in Colombia, Ecuador and Peru, while seeking to develop different initiatives with civil society organizations in the region, collaborating in strengthening their capacities. It also aims to enhance the provision of health services in border areas in Venezuela.</narrative>
  </description>
